msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Contributing Guide\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your interest in contributing to this project! We welcome all forms of contribution, including but not limited to: reporting issues, submitting code, improving documentation, and providing suggestions.\n"
"\n"
"## How to Contribute\n"
"\n"
"### Reporting Issues\n"
"\n"
"If you encounter a bug or have a feature request, please create an issue on the [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/your-repo/issues) page. When submitting an issue, please provide as much detail as possible, including:\n"
"\n"
"- A clear description of the problem or suggestion\n"
"- Steps to reproduce the issue (if applicable)\n"
"- Expected behavior and actual behavior\n"
"- Environment information (operating system, browser version, etc.)\n"
"\n"
"### Submitting Code\n"
"\n"
"1. Fork this repository to your own GitHub account.\n"
"2. Clone the forked repository to your local machine:\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   git clone https://github.com/your-username/your-repo.git\n"
"   ```\n"
"3. Create a new branch for your changes:\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   git checkout -b feature/your-feature-name\n"
"   ```\n"
"4. Make your changes and ensure the code style and quality meet the project standards.\n"
"5. Commit your changes:\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   git commit -m \"Description of your changes\"\n"
"   ```\n"
"6. Push your changes to your forked repository:\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   git push origin feature/your-feature-name\n"
"   ```\n"
"7. Submit a Pull Request (PR) on GitHub, describing your changes and the problem they solve.\n"
"\n"
"### Code Style\n"
"\n"
"- Follow the existing code style and conventions in the project.\n"
"- Ensure your code is readable and maintainable.\n"
"- Add appropriate comments where necessary.\n"
"\n"
"### Testing\n"
"\n"
"- Before submitting code, make sure all existing tests pass.\n"
"- If you add new features, please write corresponding tests.\n"
"\n"
"### Documentation\n"
"\n"
"If you improve or add documentation, please ensure the content is accurate and clear.\n"
"\n"
"## Development Process\n"
"\n"
"1. After submitting a PR, the maintainers will review your code.\n"
"2. If changes are needed, we will provide feedback in the PR.\n"
"3. Once the code is approved, it will be merged into the main branch.\n"
"\n"
"## Code of Conduct\n"
"\n"
"Please follow the project's [Code of Conduct](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) to ensure a friendly and respectful community environment.\n"
"\n"
"## Contact\n"
"\n"
"If you have any questions, feel free to contact us via [email](mailto:your-email@example.com).\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your support and contributions!\n"

